    "long_instructions": "## **Test Your Movie Filter**\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Describe your filter to AI and ask it to give you test cases to check if it works correctly.\r\n\r\n2. For each test case, write down:\r\n\r\n   * what you expect to happen\r\n   * what actually happens in the app\r\n\r\n3. If the actual results do not match the expected results, revise your filter code.\r\n\r\n4. Add a `//` comment above your filter explaining what condition it checks.",
